<title>USA: Parker Hannifin sees Q1 under by 10 to 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Parker Hannifin sees Q1 under by 10 to 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Hannifin Corp said on Thursday that it expects its first quarter results to be 10 to 15 percent below analysts' expectations and below last year's first quarter results of $0.77 per share.</p>
<p>First Call estimates weren't available.</p>
<p>The company attributed the numbers to disappointing industrial order rates and resulting lower shipments in September.</p>
<p>The company, which supplies motion and control components for the aerospace industry, said it expects to release first quarter results October 16.</p>
</text>
